Package: panglm
Type: Package
Title: Fast Generalized Linear Models for Panel Data
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person("Imad", "El Badisy", email = "elbadisyimad@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast estimation of pooled, fixed-effects (within), and
    random-effects generalized linear models for panel data, using
    'Rcpp', 'RcppArmadillo' and 'RcppParallel' for the numerical core
    and 'data.table' for panel bookkeeping. Provides classic summary()
    tables (estimate, standard error, z value, p-value) comparable to
    stats::glm().
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ielbadisy/panglm
BugReports: https://github.com/ielbadisy/panglm/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports:
    Rcpp,
    data.table,
    stats
